{"type":"message","id":"fceb10aa","parentId":"c9a30c92","timestamp":"2026-03-11T01:48:44.740Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:e1b719dc-47fb-45f7-b4b2-c36742813ce6 vault-sync] Sync the Obsidian vault: 1) cd ~/obsidian-vault && git add -A 2) If there are changes, commit with message including current timestamp (format: \"Vault auto-save $(date +'%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')\") 3) git push to https://github.com/TeraHertz2000/tera-vault. Report only if there were changes and the push succeeded.\nCurrent time: Wednesday, March 11th, 2026 — 1:48 AM (UTC) / 2026-03-11 01:48 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773193724732}}
